  "Tutup dialog": "Close dialog",
  "Jelajahi peta kurikulum 2021 dan 2026, prasyarat mata kuliah, roadmap kuliah, dan arsip ujian S1 Ilmu Komputer UGM.": "Explore the 2021 and 2026 curricula, course prerequisites, study roadmaps, and exam archives for UGM Computer Science.",
  "Temukan arsip soal UTS dan UAS Ilmu Komputer UGM dari Himakom, dikelompokkan menurut mata kuliah dan tahun.": "Find UGM Computer Science midterm and final exam papers from Himakom, grouped by course and year.",
