  "Useful computer science learning, thesis writing, and exam archive resources.": "Useful computer science learning, thesis writing, and exam archive resources.",
  "Roadmap Kuliah": "Study Roadmap",
  "Susun rencana kuliah S1 Ilmu Komputer UGM per semester berdasarkan kurikulum, peminatan, kegiatan, dan target lulus 7 atau 8 semester.": "Plan your UGM Computer Science studies by semester, curriculum, specialization, activities, and a 7- or 8-semester graduation target.",
  "Konten gagal dimuat. Periksa koneksi internet.": "Could not load the content. Check your internet connection.",
  "Bagaimana cara berkontribusi?": "How can I contribute?",
  "Siapa pun bisa ikut mengembangkan g-13. Kode sumbernya terbuka di": "Anyone can help develop g-13. The source code is available on",
  ". Punya ide, menemukan bug, atau ingin mengoreksi kurikulum? Langsung buat": ". Have an idea, found a bug, or want to correct the curriculum? Open an",
  "atau kirim": "or send a",
  ". Kontribusi kecil juga berarti, termasuk perbaikan teks dan laporan masalah. Untuk koreksi kurikulum, sertakan sumber resmi.": ". Small contributions matter too, including copy edits and bug reports. Include official sources when correcting curriculum data.",
  "Bagaimana cara membaca peta kurikulum?": "How do I read the curriculum map?",
  "Mata kuliah dikelompokkan menurut semester. Garis menghubungkan prasyarat ke mata kuliah yang mensyaratkannya. Arahkan kursor atau fokuskan mata kuliah untuk menyorot koneksinya, lalu pilih untuk membuka detail. Gunakan tombol di kanan bawah untuk beralih ke daftar.": "Courses are grouped by semester. Lines connect prerequisites to the courses that require them. Hover over or focus a course to highlight its connections, then select it for details. Use the view switch next to search to see the course list.",
  "Bagaimana cara mengganti versi kurikulum?": "How do I switch curriculum versions?",
  "Buka tombol filter di samping pencarian, lalu pilih kurikulum 2021 atau 2026. Mata kuliah pilihan dikelompokkan di bawah kolom semester.": "Open the filter button next to search, then choose the 2021 or 2026 curriculum. Elective courses are grouped below the semester columns.",
  "Apa perbedaan peta kurikulum dan roadmap kuliah?": "How does the curriculum map differ from a study roadmap?",
  "Peta kurikulum menampilkan mata kuliah dan hubungan prasyarat dalam suatu versi kurikulum. Roadmap menyusun rencana per semester berdasarkan jawaban kuis dan target selesai 7 atau 8 semester. Rencana ini perlu dicocokkan dengan ketentuan resmi prodi sebelum menentukan KRS.": "The curriculum map shows courses and prerequisite relationships within a curriculum version. The roadmap builds a semester plan based on your quiz answers and a 7- or 8-semester target. Check the plan against official program requirements before registering for courses.",
  "Bagaimana cara menggunakan Arsip Ujian?": "How do I use the exam archive?",
  "Cari atau pilih mata kuliah, buka folder tahun, lalu pilih berkas ujian untuk melihat pratinjau. Tombol pada pratinjau tersedia untuk mengunduh, menyalin tautan, atau membuka berkas di Google Drive. Arsip berasal dari Himakom UGM dan berlaku lintas versi kurikulum.": "Search for or select a course, open a year folder, then choose an exam file to preview it. Preview controls let you download, copy a link, or open the file in Google Drive. The archive comes from Himakom UGM and applies across curriculum versions.",
  "g-13 adalah proyek open source yang dibangun bersama komunitas. Siapa pun bisa memakai, mempelajari, dan ikut memperbaikinya.": "g-13 is an open source community project. Anyone can use it, learn from it, and help improve it.",
